aYvTDEAayfQWHIhgfZR1t_yMZ7BH9lZ-Fg&oe=6AF5C408"}, {"file_name": "Pirate 2 - Golfer + shark.png", "id": "1274993477981891", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618069_1274993481315224_8528695110052518896_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gRRKyh-J_icQ7kNvwFoAsdf&_nc_oc=AdoT5jlajrbh59R_dVpAh3EAzdw_DJUNYxy12IJxbqij7KhiAYhbhLVLNRCfMvUOSFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQScDnrbNSVwUwHq5e6fDvJ6B5Wx-v156iInSqep9e1f6w&oe=6AF5D682"}, {"file_name": "Adobe Express - file.png", "id": "4261575347491675", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619697_4261575350825008_4656764706867764070_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=duy2cB0cHzQQ7kNvwEn5GIj&_nc_oc=AdpJ9T_5uc3b6x85A1mczrZ99_sXHZfFdfjGWsmJaMGNbk58peGz70SQfH52eEb71YM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTrrNHzz6ZRw-HPCFLKQlbQPu8V3PH-h85BSVEPw1xh9A&oe=6AF5E9E3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fruitgolf_splash_screen_psd_B.png", "id": "1541089814205533", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623585_1541089817538866_301293638521670236_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bY4_2topqAgQ7kNvwFqZ1Z5&_nc_oc=AdqFsK1Rov6UM0sWSxJ0yeuPfVHss9_rl3weB9hm7LgWxbgig-bh4_W8jLGAOfJVMHY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqGEP-bRNmYTonwHsS76rXwPdQdgdi_iuT1f46ioByJA&oe=6AF5F110"}, "display_name": "Fruit Golf", "keywords": ["family", "party", "multiplayer", "coop", "battle"], "long_description": "# A Party Game Built on Pure Sabotage.\nTake turns surviving the course while your friends unleash sabotage; sharks, explosions, flying pigs, and total nonsense. Winning is optional. Ruining someone else\u2019s turn is mandatory.\n{1178795550894396}\n**Choose Carefully. Every Fruit Plays by Different Rules.** Every fruit bends the rules in its own way, with unique physics and quirks that can turn a simple putt into a power move\u2026 If you can master it! \n{871299389056939}\n# HOW TO PLAY:\n\n# MULTIPLE HEADSETS\nGo head-to-head in VR! Online or in-person, take turns golfing and sabotaging.\n\n# ONE HEADSET HOTSEAT\nOne headset, many saboteurs! Friends join FREE on phones (www.fruitgolf.com) to wreak havoc.\n\n# SOLO PRACTICE\nHone your swing, conquer challenges, and enjoy the hilarious physics of Fruit Golf! \n{2057401171694269}**Unlock the Drip. Flex the Chaos.** Crush challenges, unlock ridiculous gear, and make sure everyone knows you did it first.\n{861375006303270}**Weaponized Nonsense.** Sabotage every move with floppy sharks, ectoplasm, portals, mouse traps and more! If it causes chaos, it\u2019s fair game.\n{3524926690977542}**Golf Course or Battle Arena?** Fight it out in wildly themed spaces; underwater, in orbit, on the kitchen counter, then stack the deck with obstacles and turn it into pure mayhem!", "short_description": "A Game Built on Sabotage! One headset, many saboteurs! Mobile friends join for FREE (www.fruitgolf.com) to add to the chaos. \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Coal Car Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/contact-us", "website_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "SOCIAL", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["S